<title>SINGAPORE: Alliance Tech back into profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>Alliance Tech back into profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				1.82 vs   7.68 (loss)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     2.68 vs  13.85 (loss)</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)   2.91 vs  13.84 (loss)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 38.51 vs  22.77</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.55 vs   0.91</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    4.08 vs   2.33</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		5.92 vs   4.93</p>
<p>    Exceptional items			nil vs   0.39 (loss)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  0.67 vs   8.88 (loss)</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	     0.44 vs   0.13 (loss)</p>
<p>    Tax					 0.81 vs   0.19</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (gain) 1.51 vs   1.52 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Alliance Technology and Development Ltd is a diversified leisure company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
